[node name="HelpText" type="Label" parent="HelpPanel" unique_id=550818716]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.95, 0.88, 0.75, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "CONTROLS  (keyboard + mouse  |  gamepad)

Fly: WASD or arrows  |  left stick
Aim: mouse  |  right stick
Cannon: left click  |  RT
Torpedo: right click  |  RB
Brake: Ctrl  |  LT
Boost (hold): Shift  |  A
Drift (hold): Space  |  B or LB
Jettison cargo: X  |  X
Ship screen: Tab  |  Back
Pause menu: Esc  |  Start
Hide this: F1

Shoot glowing asteroids to chip ore loose,
fly close to scoop it up. Torpedoes crack
rocks fast. In a rift, follow the green
edge arrow to an extraction beacon before it collapses.
Die and you lose your cargo."
